      "value": {
        "id": "Shop#8d2tNlJ6",
        "title": "Checkout stops making the shopper wait",
        "narrative": "Today Place order makes the shopper wait while it reserves the stock, charges the card, saves the paid order and sends the receipt email, and Timeout guard cancels any order still running after 10 seconds. The Queued fulfilment proposal answers the shopper once the order is saved as pending and the payment has started. A new webhook records the payment, and a new worker, fed by a queue, reserves the stock and sends the receipt.",
