      "kind": "beat",
      "value": {
        "id": "Shop#FL9Sgryx",
        "title": "Stock and the receipt move to a worker behind a queue",
        "narrative": "After marking the order paid, the webhook publishes order paid to Order events, and the queue delivers it to Fulfilment worker. The worker reserves the items through Reserve route and sends the receipt to Email provider, the two calls that used to run inside Place order. A failed email is now retried with backoff by the worker, while the shopper already has their page. Stock is now reserved after the card is paid, so an item can sell out after its shopper has paid.",
