      "kind": "beat",
      "value": {
        "id": "Shop#F5QYhOyC",
        "title": "Duplicate payment events can fulfil an order twice",
        "narrative": "Payment provider may deliver the same payment succeeded event more than once. If Payment webhook publishes order paid for each delivery, Fulfilment worker is asked again to reserve the same order's items and send its receipt, so the order can hold its stock twice and the shopper can get two receipts. That makes Payment webhook the place that needs the closest look: a correct webhook marks an order paid and publishes order paid once per order, however many times the event arrives.",
